    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "<p><bdi lang=\"en\">The logo of <bdi lang=\"\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Danish_Football_Association\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Danish Football Association\"><span title=\"sports governing body organizing association football in Denmark\">Danish Football Association</span></a> – sports governing body organizing association football in Denmark</bdi></bdi>\n</p><p>As per <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.kb-boldklub.dk/om-kb/profil/kbs-logo/\">KBs logo</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dbukoebenhavn.dk/om-os/historie/gode-historier/korte-historier/nr-1-10/6/\">Carlsberg betaler</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.carlsberg.com/da-dk/fremskridt-siden-1847/artikel-2019-logo-tilbage-til-original/\">Nyt design trækker Carlsberg-logo tilbage til originalen</a> and 'En del af det største' by Lars Berendt (2017; ISBN: 9788711565896), chapter 13 (Drømmeduo), it is presumed that the original logo of the Danish Football Association (DBU) was designed and created by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thorvald_Bindesb%C3%B8ll\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Thorvald Bindesbøll\">Thorvald Bindesbøll</a> around 1900. The logo has had several aesthetic improvements throughout the years with latest adjustments being implemented in 1999 by the advertising agency Saatchi &amp; Saatchi as part of DBU's new design guidelines and visual identity implementation throughout the central part of the national organization.\n</p>\nAs per 'Dansk Boldspil-Union Designmanual 2.0' (2013), section under \"DBUs logo - jura\", <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dbu.dk/presse/retningslinjer/kommercielle/\">Kommercielle retningslinjer</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.rettigheder.dk/soeg?t=Dansk+Boldspil+Union+1889\">rettigheder.dk Resultater</a>, the logo of DBU is trademarked (EU varemærke), and hence protected under the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.retsinformation.dk/eli/lta/2019/88\">Danish Trademark Act</a>.",
      "source": "commons-desc-page"
    },
